# Additional review guidance

Copy this file to `.esuna/guidelines.md` at your repository root and replace
these examples with your team's rules. The entire file is injected verbatim
into every reviewer prompt, including verification prompts. It is optional.

- Prefer concrete, actionable defects over style preferences.
- Check error handling and boundary conditions.
- Explain the failure scenario and impact in each finding message.
- Preserve the requested `FILE|LINE|SEVERITY|MESSAGE` output format.
